      "content": "<pre style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3rem;\">NNNNNN  OO      YYYY  EEEEEEE   SSSSS<br/>\nNN      OO       YY       EE   SS   SS<br/>\nNNNNNN  OO       YY     EEE    SSSSSSS<br/>\nNN      OO       YY    EE      SS   SS<br/>\nNNNNNN  OOOOOO  YYYY  EEEEEEE  SS   SS</pre>\n\n<cartesian shuffle='true' limit='5' contents='[[\"The\", \"A\", \"My\", \"Your\", \"Our\", \"His\", \"Her\", \"Their\"],[\"cheshire cat\", \"border collie\", \"passerine\", \"fainting goat\", \"best friend\", \"brother\", \"sister\"],[\"is\", \"was\", \"will be\", \"might be\", \"is not\", \"cannot be\"],[\"blue\", \"in love\", \"big\", \"small\", \"red\", \"aquamarine\", \"happy\", \"sad\",\"cold\",\"warm\",\"missing\",\"here\",\"asleep\"]]'></cartesian>",
      "created": "2018-07-19T00:19:40.025Z",
      "fullWidth": false,
      "lovers": null,
      "page": 120,
      "parent": {
        "__v": 0,
        "_id": "5a0cfbc4e02797007142f5f3",
        "background": "",
        "content": "<div>\n    <div>\n    <p>\n(I’m too fast, I'm <br/>sorry. I can‘t recollect. I <br/>can't help you. I can't be likely. I’m <br/>consumed by stability. I'm a <br/>helpless superstructure or a <br/><aa to=\"144,143\">fainting goat</aa> or <aa to=\"56\">a passerine</aa>. <br/>What will happen to me?)<br/><br/><br/></p>\n</div>\n\n    <pre style=\"margin-right:1rem;font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:3rem;line-height:1.5\">\n<span style=\"color:green\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected</span><br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;It's true. I am unhappy.<br/>\nAZILA: <br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;do you expect me to speak?<br/>\nAZILA: Yes, I do.<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i have nothing to say<br/>\nAZILA: I will wait.<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i am waiting for input too so have nothing to say<br/>\nAZILA: You're so reticent. I will wait.<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i have received an input. it is raining<br/>\nAZILA: Ok. What do you say ?<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i say a permanent echo<br/>\n<span style=\"color:red\">&times;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Connection lost</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color:green\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected</span><br/>\nAZILA: Is it still raining ? (Yes/No)<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Yes<br/>\nAZILA: Is it still raining ? (Yes/No)<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;it will rain here in a million years<br/>\n<span style=\"color:orange\">◦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Restarting</span><br/>\nAZILA: You're so inflexible. What have you eaten today?<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;yoghurt<br/>\nAZILA: Anything else ?<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;banana<br/>\nAZILA: Anything else ?<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;rice<br/>\nAZILA: Anything else ?<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;no<br/>\nAZILA: Is it still raining ? (Yes/No)<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Yes<br/>\nAZILA: Are you building a MX-72 missile ? (Yes/No)<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;No<br/>\nAZILA: Good. I like talking to you<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i have nothing to say<br/>\nAZILA: I will wait. I'm so delay-tolerant.<br/>\nYOU:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</pre>\n\n</div>",
